{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、握手会会場に\nクレープの屋台がきていたので、\nクレープ2つと\n家に帰ってから\nロールケーキをたべました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても甘くて美味しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものだいすきです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は12枚目シングル\n太陽ノック最後の個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服の画像が真っ暗で全然見えないから、明日までに明るくしておくから\n握手会のブログは明日書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません(╥ω╥`)。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は宇宙兄弟での\nツーショット写真しか\n載せないので覚悟しておいて\nください！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木坂４６の、のでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストに真夏さん高山さんが\n来てくださりとても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山さんと千葉あるあるで共感しあったり、真夏さんをいじったりと\nとても楽しい時間でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ中でも話したんだけど\nいつか、「ふつおたコーナー」だけを\n1時間やるのもやってみたい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時は高山さんと真夏さんと3人でおしゃべりしたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオの最後で話しましたが\n私のMCも来週のラジオで最後です(；д；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなしいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎののに関しては\nまた違うブログで話しますが\n来週も絶対にきいてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のエンディングでは\nお父さんの好きな曲でもある\nここにいる理由を流したの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週のエンディングは\nお母さんが好きな曲を選んだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇宙兄弟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会となりのレーンだったから\n3部のとき間違えて\nみり愛のレーンに行っちゃった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛のファンの方\n失礼致しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の0時～\n乃木坂工事中で2期生が\nフィーチャーされた企画が\n放送されます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生全員で乃木坂工事中のスタジオにいくのは初めてで\nのぎどこの2013年の5月に放送された\n1期生2期生でスタジオ収録に参加した以来だったので、約30ヶ月ぶりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことは、、、\n2年と6ヶ月ぶり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい久しぶりだったけど\nとても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛がいなくて\n2期生全員ではなかったけど\nまた今度2期生全員で\n何か企画や番組ができるように\nがんばります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の放送\n絶対みてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛と\nチョコマシュマロピザ\nたべにいかないと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、今日の握手会で\nみんなに食べすぎだよーって言われたので、反抗してもっと食べちゃおうかな！と思いました٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそです、ごめんなさい(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！あのね！\nみり愛すごい大食いなんだけど\n食べるのも早いの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の海でのお昼ご飯\nセットにしたんだけど\n12分25秒11の時間で\n食べ終えたんだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのくらい早いのか気になって\nみり愛がいただきますすると\n同時にタイマーではかったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛ってきっと\n自分の限界まで食べたことないんだろうな～(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛がいつか限界まで食べる！！！といったときには、絶対に同行したいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/22/0400080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も内容のないブログでしたが\n明日もかきまーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみてねー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！！！！"}],"source":"archive"}